Z||000001||1FST2M6||03-05-2001||06:56 PM||||i've taken the dampners off all the cars i've worked on.. the quicker steering responce and less fatigue on the arms is nice.. the only down fall is highway driving.. if you do a lot.. replace it don't throw it away... ||||reg||1
